ank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fd97f04a-5d93-433e-9b69-62604793b6a0\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanseverina\" title=\"Sanseverina\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Sanseverina.png/25px-Portrait_Sanseverina.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Sanseverina.png/38px-Portrait_Sanseverina.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Sanseverina.png/50px-Portrait_Sanseverina.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanseverina\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Sanseverina.png/25px-Portrait_Sanseverina.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Portrait_Sanseverina.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanseverina\" title=\"Sanseverina\">Sanseverina</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Palace\" title=\"Szarr Palace\">Szarr Palace</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1281&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1010</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Sansy, I've been invited to play at a party at the Szarr Palace tonight in their ballroom. Show the chamberlain at the door this note and he'll let you in to join me. Wear your best dress!\n</p><p>Callira\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202911\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time u